<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19916" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιβλίον</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βυβλίον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strip of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βύβλος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.8.4
			</span></i>: hence, <i>paper, document</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.123
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.128
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				974
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ β. τοῦ ψηφίσματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1.61
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ἀποστασίου</span>
			<i>notice</i> of divorce, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				19.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιβλίδιον</span>
			, <i>petition</i> to the Government, = Lat.
				<i>libellus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				422
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				86.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέλτος</span>
			, <i>tablet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>To.</u>
				7.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>book</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				304
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theognet.
				1.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				26d
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέγα β. ἴσον τῷ μεγάλῳ κακῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					359
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>book</i> as the division of a work, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ πρώτῳ β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2
				</span></i>
			
			<u>Praef.</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.329
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ β.</span>
			<i>place in which books are kept, library</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεθήκατε εἰς τὰ β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					37.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ β. τὰ ἅγια</span> the sacred
				<i>books</i> or <u>Scriptures</u>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ma.</u>
				12.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ β. τοῦ νόμου</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.56
			</span></i>.</div>
